# Interview Feedback

## Summary
One interviewer's written feedback: `interviewer` (linksTo Employee), `interviewDate`, a 1–5 `rating` and free-text `notes`. Lighter than a Scorecard — for loops that collect a single impression per interviewer rather than scored criteria.

## Usage
```ts
import { InterviewFeedbackField } from '@cardstack/catalog/cards/hr/interview-feedback-field';

@field feedback = containsMany(InterviewFeedbackField);
```

## Non-goals
No aggregate: averaging feedback into a decision is the consumer's call.
